      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claude Code Best Practice is a GitHub repository that provides practical guidance for effectively using Claude AI's coding capabilities through structured examples and workflows. It demonstrates how to leverage Claude's strengths in code generation and analysis by implementing specific prompting techniques and iterative refinement processes. Developers can use this resource to improve their AI-assisted coding workflows, experiment with different prompting strategies, and adapt the examples to their own projects for more efficient code development and debugging.",
        "zh": "Claude Code Best Practice 是一个专注于提升 Claude AI 编码应用效果的实践指南项目，通过系统化的示例和工作流展示如何充分发挥 Claude 在代码生成与分析方面的能力。该项目核心在于演示如何运用特定的提示词技巧和迭代优化方法，将 Claude 的代码理解与生成优势转化为实际开发效率。开发者可以借鉴其中的结构化实践模式，尝试不同的提示策略，并将这些方法应用到自己的项目中，从而更高效地进行代码编写、重构和问题排查，提升 AI 辅助编程的实用效果。",
        "es": "Claude Code Best Practice is a GitHub repository that provides practical guidance for effectively using Claude AI's coding capabilities through structured examples and workflows. It demonstrates how to leverage Claude's strengths in code generation and analysis by implementing specific prompting techniques and iterative refinement processes. Developers can use this resource to improve their AI-assisted coding workflows, experiment with different prompting strategies, and adapt the examples to their own projects for more efficient code development and debugging.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claude-code-best-practice stands out for agentic-engineering, best-practices, and claude-ai in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Claude Code Best Practice is a GitHub repository that provides practical guidance for effectively using Claude AI's coding capabilities through structured examples and workflows. It demonstrates how to leverage Claude's strengths in code generation and analysis by implementing specific prompting techniques and iterative refinement processes. Developers can use this resource to improve their AI-assisted coding workflows, experiment with different prompting strategies, and adapt the examples to their own projects for more efficient code development and debugging.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/shanraisshan/claude-code-best-practice for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
